<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Banerj to be auctioned - paper.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banerj to be auctioned - paper.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio de Janeiro's state bank Banco do Estado do Rio de Janeiro (Banerj) will be sold off at a privatization auction December 12, a financial newspaper said.</p>
<p>Banerj's international affairs director, Luis Alberto Reategui, told investors in New York the bank would be auctioned December 12 and the buyer would have five days to pay the sale price, Gazeta Mercantil said.</p>
</text>
